<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>DataDecision | Strategic Intelligence</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Premium data and AI strategy consulting for modern enterprises." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --black: #000000;
            --dark-1: #0A0A0A;
            --dark-2: #141414;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --gray-1: #f3f4f6;
            --gray-2: #9ca3af;
            --gray-3: #4b5563;
            --accent: #FF003C; /* Dangerous Red */
            --accent-hover: #CC0030;
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --border-hover: rgba(255, 0, 60, 0.5);
            --font-head: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            --font-body: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            --radius: 0px; /* Sharp edges */
            --section-pad: 140px;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body { 
            font-family: var(--font-body); 
            background-color: var(--black); 
            color: var(--gray-1); 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        ::selection { background: var(--accent); color: var(--white); }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5 { font-family: var(--font-head); color: var(--white); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; }
        
        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: all 0.3s ease; }
        ul { list-style: none; }
        img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }

        .container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; }
        .section { padding: var(--section-pad) 0; }

        /* BRUTALIST BUTTONS */
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            font-family: var(--font-head);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent);
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--accent);
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: var(--accent);
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transform-origin: right;
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            z-index: -1;
        }
        .btn:hover { color: var(--black); border-color: var(--accent); }
        .btn:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); transform-origin: left; }

        .btn-solid { background: var(--white); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--white); }
        .btn-solid::before { background: var(--accent); }
        .btn-solid:hover { color: var(--white); border-color: var(--accent); }

        /* NAVBAR */
        .navbar {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%;
            padding: 24px 0; z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .nav-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        
        .logo-img {
            height: 28px;
            filter: invert(1);
            mix-blend-mode: screen;
        }

        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gray-2); }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }
        
        /* HERO */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            padding-top: 100px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(255,0,60,0.08) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%);
        }
        .hero-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;
        }
        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .hero-title span { color: var(--accent); }
        .hero-lead {
            font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--gray-2); max-width: 500px; margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .hero-stats {
            display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .stat-num { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray-3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; }

        .hero-image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            height: 700px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero-image-wrapper::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }
        .hero-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.2); }

        /* SECTION HEADERS */
        .section-header { margin-bottom: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; }
        .section-header h2 { font-size: 4rem; letter-spacing: -1px; max-width: 700px; }
        .section-eyebrow { 
            font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); 
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 20px; display: block;
        }

        /* EXPERTISE GRID */
        .expertise-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--border); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .expertise-card {
            background: var(--dark-1);
            padding: 60px 40px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }
        .expertise-card:hover { background: var(--black); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent); }
        .expertise-num { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--gray-3); margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 700; }
        .expertise-card:hover .expertise-num { color: var(--accent); }
        .expertise-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .expertise-card p { color: var(--gray-2); font-size: 0.95rem; }

        /* BUSINESS CHALLENGE */
        .challenge { background: var(--dark-1); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .challenge-wrapper { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        .challenge-content { padding: 100px 80px 100px 0; }
        .challenge-image {
            background: url('/business-challenge-photo.jpg') center/cover;
            filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.2);
            border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: relative;
        }
        .challenge-image::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--dark-1), transparent);
        }
        .challenge-list { margin-top: 60px; }
        .challenge-item { padding: 30px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 30px; }
        .challenge-item-icon { color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--font-head); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; }
        .challenge-item-text h4 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .challenge-item-text p { color: var(--gray-2); }

        /* CASE STUDIES */
        .cs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 40px; }
        .cs-card {
            display: block;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--dark-1);
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }
        .cs-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
        .cs-img-wrap { height: 400px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
        .cs-img-wrap::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); transition: background 0.3s; }
        .cs-card:hover .cs-img-wrap::after { background: rgba(255,0,60,0.2); }
        .cs-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(100%); transition: transform 0.7s ease; }
        .cs-card:hover .cs-img { transform: scale(1.05); }
        
        .cs-content { padding: 40px; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 10; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.9), transparent); }
        .cs-metric { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 3rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1; }
        .cs-title { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .cs-desc { color: var(--gray-1); font-size: 0.95rem; }

        /* FOOTER */
        .footer { background: var(--black); padding: 100px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; margin-bottom: 80px; }
        .footer h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .footer-links h4 { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray-3); margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .footer-links ul li { margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .footer-links a { color: var(--gray-1); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
        .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--gray-3); font-size: 0.85rem; }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero-grid, .challenge-wrapper, .cs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .hero-image-wrapper { height: 400px; display: none; }
            .expertise-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
            .section-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; }
            .hero-title { font-size: 3.5rem; }
            .challenge-content { padding: 60px 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="container nav-inner">
            <a href="/" class="logo">
                <img src="/datadecision-logo.png" alt="DataDecision" class="logo-img" />
            </a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#expertise">Expertise</a>
                <a href="#work">Work</a>
                <a href="#challenge">Methodology</a>
                <a href="mailto:contact@datadecision.consulting" class="btn btn-solid" style="padding: 10px 20px;">Engage</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1 class="hero-title">ENGINEERING<br>DECISIONS<br><span>THAT MATTER.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-lead">We turn complex data pipelines and AI models into ruthless competitive advantages. Elite strategy consulting for the modern enterprise.</p>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
                    <a href="#work" class="btn btn-solid">View Outcomes</a>
                    <a href="mailto:contact@datadecision.consulting" class="btn">Request Audit</a>
                </div>
                
                <div class="hero-stats">
                    <div>
                        <div class="stat-num">$2B+</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Value Unlocked</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="stat-num">45%</div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Avg. Efficiency Gain</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
                <img src="/operation-manufacturing-efficiency.jpg" alt="AI Server" class="hero-img" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EXPERTISE -->
    <section id="expertise" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div>
                    <span class="section-eyebrow">Capabilities</span>
                    <h2>PRECISION DATA ARCHITECTURE.</h2>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="expertise-grid">
                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-num">01</div>
                    <h3>AI & Machine Learning</h3>
                    <p>Production-grade predictive models and Generative AI workflows designed to automate complex decision-making and reduce operational overhead.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-num">02</div>
                    <h3>Data Engineering</h3>
                    <p>Scalable, fault-tolerant data pipelines and warehouse modernization. We transform messy, siloed data into highly structured intelligence.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-num">03</div>
                    <h3>Decision Intelligence</h3>
                    <p>Translating raw mathematical outputs into board-level strategic roadmaps. Real-time dashboards, KPI tracking, and probabilistic modeling.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-num">04</div>
                    <h3>Cloud Infrastructure</h3>
                    <p>Secure, multi-cloud deployments (AWS, GCP, Azure) optimized for high-performance computing, cost-efficiency, and strict regulatory compliance.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-num">05</div>
                    <h3>Governance & Security</h3>
                    <p>Zero-trust data architecture. Ensuring your proprietary intelligence is heavily fortified, compliant, and accessible only to authorized entities.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <div class="expertise-num">06</div>
                    <h3>Executive Advisory</h3>
                    <p>Direct partnership with C-suite leadership to align technical AI capabilities with aggressive business growth and acquisition targets.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CHALLENGE -->
    <section id="challenge" class="section challenge">
        <div class="container challenge-wrapper">
            <div class="challenge-content">
                <span class="section-eyebrow">The Method</span>
                <h2>FROM CHAOS TO CLARITY.</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--gray-2); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 20px;">Most enterprises fail at AI because they lack a clean data foundation. We deploy a brutal, systematic approach to audit, fix, and scale your intelligence.</p>
                
                <div class="challenge-list">
                    <div class="challenge-item">
                        <div class="challenge-item-icon">01</div>
                        <div class="challenge-item-text">
                            <h4>Tactical Audit</h4>
                            <p>We analyze your current pipelines, identifying data silos, security flaws, and bottlenecks in decision velocity.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="challenge-item">
                        <div class="challenge-item-icon">02</div>
                        <div class="challenge-item-text">
                            <h4>Infrastructure Overhaul</h4>
                            <p>Re-engineering your data lakes and warehousing to ensure pristine, real-time data flows ready for machine learning.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="challenge-item">
                        <div class="challenge-item-icon">03</div>
                        <div class="challenge-item-text">
                            <h4>Algorithmic Deployment</h4>
                            <p>Implementing custom AI agents and predictive models specifically trained on your proprietary data.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="challenge-image"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WORK -->
    <section id="work" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div>
                    <span class="section-eyebrow">Outcomes</span>
                    <h2>PROVEN IMPACT.</h2>
                </div>
                <a href="mailto:contact@datadecision.consulting" class="btn">View All Case Studies</a>
            </div>

            <div class="cs-grid">
                <a href="/case-study-supply-chain" class="cs-card">
                    <div class="cs-img-wrap">
                        <img src="/supply-chain-visibility.jpg" alt="Supply Chain" class="cs-img" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="cs-content">
                        <div class="cs-metric">40%</div>
                        <h3 class="cs-title">Global Supply Chain Optimization</h3>
                        <p class="cs-desc">Reduced logistics overhead via predictive anomaly detection for a Fortune 500 retailer.</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                
                <a href="/case-study-retail-demand" class="cs-card">
                    <div class="cs-img-wrap">
                        <img src="/ai-driven-retail-demand.jpg" alt="Retail AI" class="cs-img" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="cs-content">
                        <div class="cs-metric">$12M</div>
                        <h3 class="cs-title">AI-Driven Retail Demand</h3>
                        <p class="cs-desc">Recouped lost revenue by deploying real-time inventory forecasting models.</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-grid">
                <div>
                    <img src="/datadecision-logo.png" alt="DataDecision" style="height: 32px; filter: invert(1); mix-blend-mode: screen; margin-bottom: 30px;" />
                    <p style="color: var(--gray-2); max-width: 400px;">DataDecision Consulting provides elite, uncompromised technical strategy for enterprises ready to dominate their sectors using AI.</p>
                    <a href="mailto:contact@datadecision.consulting" class="btn" style="margin-top: 30px;">contact@datadecision.consulting</a>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <h4>SERVICES</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#expertise">AI & Machine Learning</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#expertise">Data Engineering</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#expertise">Cloud Infrastructure</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#expertise">Executive Advisory</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <h4>COMPANY</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#work">Case Studies</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#challenge">Methodology</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>&copy; 2026 DataDecision Consulting. All rights reserved.</p>
                <p>Designed for Dominance.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
